00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,440
unless I feel it is a secret I really wanna tell.
除非我真想讲

198
00:10:57,470 --> 00:10:59,840
That is not reassuring, babe.
这话听着一点也不让人放心 宝贝

199
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:01,290
I don't wanna go.
我真不想去

200
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,640
No!
不行

201
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:05,240
No, we have to. Natasha will kill me.
不行 得去 不然娜塔莎会把我宰了

202
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:08,590
I feel like... I feel like she's, like, rude,
我觉得 她给人感觉态度不好

203
00:11:08,610 --> 00:11:09,690
like, tonally.
说话带刺

204
00:11:09,710 --> 00:11:11,860
Oh, she definitely has a very rude tone.
可不是 她讲话可刺人了

205
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:12,840
Right?
对吧

206
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,940
She's got a really rude tone.
她说话语气真有问题

207
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:18,670
Are you afraid?
你怕吗？

208
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:21,670
Yeah.
有点

209
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,030
For the pain?
是怕疼吗？

210
00:11:23,050 --> 00:11:24,470
Yeah.
是啊

211
00:11:24,710 --> 00:11:27,670
But also because it's like, a person.
但这是个独立的人啊

212
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:31,080
I wanna make a really good person.
我想养出个好人

213
00:11:31,230 --> 00:11:33,760
You're gonna make a good person.
你会把孩子带成好人的

214
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,340
It's gonna hurt so bad.
会疼得要命的

215
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:38,800
Oh, my God, it seems like it hurts so bad!
可不是 会疼死你的

216
00:11:38,820 --> 00:11:40,200
No! Don't say that.
不 别这么说

217
00:11:40,350 --> 00:11:41,370
I'm allowed to say that,
我能说

218
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,690
you're not allowed to say that.
不许你说

219
00:11:43,850 --> 00:11:45,600
Blah, blah, blah. Doesn't matter.
废话不说

220
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:47,590
Short story is, we got the house,
简而言之 房子买到了

221
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:50,290
but we had to pay, like, significantly more than we wanted to.
但花的比我们预期多得多

222
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:53,840
Do you like this house? My house?
喜欢这房子吧？我家的！

223
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:56,920
I, I do. Yeah. Oh, my God.
嗯 挺喜欢的

224
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:58,790
The wood... it's gorgeous.
木头 好有质感

225
00:11:58,810 --> 00:12:00,860
It's rich. Like dark.
高档的 很奢华

226
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:01,430
Yeah.
嗯

227
00:12:02,010 --> 00:12:03,240
What are you gonna put in it?
准备搬哪些东西来？

228
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:04,470
- In our house? - Yeah.
- 这房子？ - 对

229
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:06,240
Uh... our couch,
嗯 那沙发

230
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:07,470
our bed,
那床

231
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,080
Benny's parents' dresser.
本尼父母给她的五斗柜

232
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:10,720
All your stuff.
什么都搬来

233
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:11,750
Yes. Exactly.
对 没错

234
00:12:11,770 --> 00:12:12,750
That makes sense.
果然

235
00:12:12,770 --> 00:12:15,450
You're like a fully fledged adult now.
你现在真的长大了

236
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:18,490
Guys, how long has it been since, like, we've hung out?
大伙儿 我们有多久没聚了？

237
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,260
I'm just sort of like...
见面只能尴尬来句...

238
00:12:20,290 --> 00:12:21,350
Hi.
你好

239
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,300
Is it three years since we graduated?
我们毕业有三年了吧？

240
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,890
- Four, I think. - Oh, my God, is it four years?
- 四年了吧 - 哦 都四年了吗

241
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,710
Yeah.
是啊

242
00:12:25,730 --> 00:12:27,230
Time really does fly.
时光飞逝啊

243
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:28,790
Time really does fly.
时光真飞逝啊

244
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:30,960
But not for me or Agnes probably,
不过 对我和安尼丝大概不算

245
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:33,970
since we're still here, still at the school.
我们还待在学校里

246
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,540
You're still at your same house.
你还待在那房子里

247
00:12:35,570 --> 00:12:37,090
That little house.
那破房子里

248
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:40,570
But time probably flies for the three of you who left.
就你们三个走出去的会觉得飞逝

249
00:12:40,610 --> 00:12:42,950
- New York. - Yeah, yeah. New York.
- 去纽约啦 - 嗯 对 纽约

250
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,440
Wow.
哦

251
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,710
Good for you.
替你高兴

252
00:12:45,730 --> 00:12:47,350
Um, but it's a trip being back.
嗯 回来这趟感触挺深

253
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:50,460
I drove past the campus on my way to Agnes',
去安尼丝家路上路过学校

254
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:53,910
and I just got, like, full body chills when I saw the library.
见到图书馆就起鸡皮疙瘩

255
00:12:53,930 --> 00:12:55,450
The library. Lydie, no. please.
那图书馆 利迪 别提了

256
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,850
You know what I mean?
你懂吧

257
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:59,180
I have, like, deeply ingrained stress from that place.
那地方给我留着很深的压力印记

258
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:02,310
Yeah, Grad school was wild. I honestly feel like
对 在研究院那会儿真太狠了

259
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:04,190
I worked on that thesis for like, a decade.
我写那论文跟长征一样

260
00:13:04,210 --> 00:13:07,640
Yeah. This one time, um...on the third floor in a private room,
可不是嘛 有次我在图书馆自习室

261
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:10,360
I almost paper cut my face open with my copy of Little Dorrit
差点想用《小杜丽》那书把脸划破

262
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:10,390
{\an7}【《小杜丽》：狄更斯（英）刻画阶级与贫困的辛辣作品】

263
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:13,830
just so I could go to the hospital and have a good night's sleep.
好去医院里睡个安稳觉

264
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:16,250
I didn't do it, but I thought about it.
没真做 但闪过那念头

265
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:20,070
Yeah, sometimes I have nightmares
嗯 有时我做噩梦

266
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:23,860
where my thesis is like all blank pages, and then I eat the pages.
梦到我论文全变白纸 我还把它吃了

267
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,550
Oh, my God, that's so sad.
天呐 那好可悲

268
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:27,900
Yeah. It is really sad, huh.
是啊 可不是嘛 真的挺可悲的

269
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:31,180
So, Agnes, it was really that easy for you?
那么 安尼丝 你就过得顺风顺水了？

270
00:13:31,210 --> 00:13:33,610
No story? Nothing to share?
不想谈谈什么事情吗？

271
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:36,120
Well, it's not Agnes' fault that Decker liked her best.
那事儿可不是安尼丝的错 是德克尔太粘她

272
00:13:36,140 --> 00:13:39,250
No, it wasn't her fault,  but, um, it pissed me off.
对 不是她的错 说来我都生气

273
00:13:43,650 --> 00:13:47,180
This fish is amazing. What's... what's in it?
这鱼做的不错 里面放了什么？

274
00:13:47,470 --> 00:13:48,680
Fish.
鱼啊

275
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,690
Uh... well, how is it, you two?
你们俩近况如何？

276
00:13:51,710 --> 00:13:53,400
You're the teachers now.
都是老师了

277
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:54,730
I am still part time,
我还没有转正

278
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:57,300
but I think I'm gonna teach a class next semester...
不过下学期会让我带一门课吧

279
00:13:57,320 --> 00:14:00,370
which they haven't said is what's gonna happen, but it could.
还没正式说 但挺有戏

280
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,980
- Yeah, it could. - No. It will.
- 是啊 挺有戏 - 不 是一定会

281
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,440
Yeah. Yes. It, it will.
对 对 一定会

282
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:06,260
Well, we have news in the English department.
我们英语系这边还有新情况

283
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,600
Agnes? Agnes has big news.
安尼丝 该你的大新闻了

284
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:10,400
Bathroom. Sorry.
去下洗手间 抱歉

285
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:14,130
Agnes is now a full-time teacher. She took Wilkinson's spot.
安尼丝已转正 占了威尔金森留的位置

286
00:14:14,150 --> 00:14:15,990
Filled the spot.
是接手了 那位置

287
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:19,120
Agnes is like super young to be full-time faculty.
安尼丝真厉害 这么年轻就转正了

288
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:22,240
Yeah, she's like the youngest in fifty years, that bitch.
对 五十年来最年轻的 靠腿上位的

289
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:23,430
I'm kidding.
开玩笑啦

290
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:27,400
There's a bone.
没去干净

291
00:14:29,020 --> 00:14:30,270
What?
什么？

292
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,350
In the fish.
鱼刺没去干净

293
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,870
{\an9}【西餐通常会把鱼刺和骨头去除后上桌】

294
00:14:36,130 --> 00:14:39,340
There's, like, a bone in the fish that you served me.
你这鱼没剔干净 里面还有根鱼刺

295
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:43,190
Sorry.
抱歉

296
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,460
No, it's... it's fine.
没事 没事

297
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,400
It's just like maybe you should, like,
下次你招待客人

298
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:50,200
debone it a little bit better before you serve it to people.
把鱼刺处理好 注意点礼数

299
00:14:59,390 --> 00:15:01,130
Hello, my baby.
你好呀 我的猫宝贝

300
00:15:01,410 --> 00:15:03,180
Oh, you're a baby.
我的猫宝贝

301
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:05,030
I love you. I love you.
妈妈爱你 妈妈爱你

302
00:15:05,110 --> 00:15:06,610
Oh, you wanna get down?
噢 要下去吗？

303
00:15:06,690 --> 00:15:08,030
Okay. I'll put you down.
好 把你放下去

304
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:12,270
You leave the house, right?
你会走出这房子吧？

305
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,910
Yeah. I leave the house.
嗯 天天走出啊

306
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:17,560
I go to work. I have a job, Lydie.
得去上班 我有工作的 利迪

307
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,080
But...
但...

308
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:24,380
you're still in the same office.
你还待在那间办公室里啊

309
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:25,960
Yes.
的确

310
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:30,100
Agnes, you said that you were gonna switch.
安尼丝 你说过你会换办公室的

311
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:35,030
Well, I...I didn't wanna have to explain why it's weird for me to be in that office.
我 我可不想被迫解释为什么换

312
00:15:35,050 --> 00:15:38,370
Maybe you should say there's mold or something.
编个理由 说墙发霉之类的

313
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,320
Maybe.
也许吧

314
00:15:39,340 --> 00:15:43,800
Do you want me to call them and say there's a dead animal in the wall?
该死 要我举报说墙里有死动物发臭吗？

315
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:46,570
You are an angel from heaven, but no.
你真是大好人 但不用

316
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:48,440
It's like, I just got the job.
我刚转正

317
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:50,720
I don't even know if I should have the job.
我都不知道我配不配得上这位子

318
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:52,160
Agnes.
安尼丝 别这样

319
00:15:55,070 --> 00:15:57,200
I don't wanna complain about my office,
我不想嫌我的办公室

320
00:15:57,230 --> 00:16:00,600
which is technically huge, and there's a lot of light,
空间大 采光又好

321
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:05,290
and I can see why he liked it.
我能明白他为什么喜欢这间

322
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:10,900
Anyways, yes, I leave the house.
总之 是的 我决定走出去这房子

323
00:16:12,830 --> 00:16:14,000
Agnes...
安尼丝...

324
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:17,820
don't...
别...

325
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:19,980
die.
去死

326
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:22,920
I'm not gonna die.
我不会死的

327
00:16:25,230 --> 00:16:27,210
If I was gonna kill myself,
要真打算自尽

328
00:16:27,570 --> 00:16:29,590
I would have done it like last year...
我早在去年做了

329
00:16:30,190 --> 00:16:31,530
or the year before.
或者在前年

330
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,930
Ugh. Or, like, definitely the year before.
呃 肯定在前年

331
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:35,430
Agnes.
安尼丝 别

332
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:37,430
No. I'm not gonna die.
我不会死的

333
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:42,390
Let me return the sentiment.
那我也回敬你一句

334
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,440
You please don't die.
你也别想着去死

335
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,160
Lydie...
利迪...

336
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,440
You're having a little baby.
你怀了个小宝宝

337
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:57,530
I know.
对

338
00:16:59,470 --> 00:17:02,610
You're gonna take such good care of your little baby.
你会把宝宝照顾得很好

339
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,570
I won't die.
我不会死的

340
00:17:05,590 --> 00:17:06,500
Please don't die.
求你别死

341
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:08,460
No, you please don't die.
不 我求你

342
00:17:13,740 --> 00:17:15,530
Do you wanna say hello?
想跟宝宝打个招呼吗？

343
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,290
Hi.
嗨

344
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:27,630
I'm Agnes.
我是安尼丝

345
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:31,800
I'm your mommy.
我是你妈咪

346
00:17:31,830 --> 00:17:35,150
Lydie and Fran may tell you otherwise, but heed my words.
利迪和弗兰可能会有别的说法 但听我说

347
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,510
- I'm your mother. - Agnes!
- 我是你妈 - 安尼丝！

348
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:38,880
- Do it properly. - Yeah. All right.
- 别闹 正经点 - 好 好吧

349
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,890
Hi. I'm Agnes.
嗨 我是安尼丝

350
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:46,190
I'm not your mommy.
我不是你妈咪

351
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:51,630
I am your mommy.
我就是你妈咪

352
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:53,050
Oh, for goodness sake.
哎 真受不了你

353
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,660
I felt it kick.
我觉得宝宝踢我了

354
00:17:54,690 --> 00:17:55,720
No, you didn't.
没有 你没有

355
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:01,210
Are you gonna... Thank you.
那包...多谢

356
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,370
Don't go.
别走

357
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:05,070
Hey.
来

358
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,330
I'll see you soon.
我很快就来看你

359
00:18:08,490 --> 00:18:09,400
When?
什么时候？

360
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:10,730
Come to New York.
来纽约吧

361
00:18:10,750 --> 00:18:12,130
I've got an extra bed.
我有空床

362
00:18:13,630 --> 00:18:15,450
Tell Fran that I hate them.
跟弗兰说我讨厌TA

363
00:18:13,630 --> 00:18:15,490
{\an9}【TA为中性代词】

364
00:18:15,470 --> 00:18:16,350
No.
才不

365
00:18:16,370 --> 00:18:17,730
No, I don't hate them.
好吧 其实不讨厌TA

366
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:19,010
I know, babe.
我知道 宝贝

367
00:18:19,810 --> 00:18:22,060
- Love you. - Love you.
- 爱你 - 也爱你

368
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:27,230
Um, no.
哦 等下

369
00:18:32,050 --> 00:18:33,670
Come soon.
快点回来哦

370
00:18:33,690 --> 00:18:34,870
Not because of, like,
不是因为...

371
00:18:34,890 --> 00:18:37,220
not because I'm gonna kill myself, but just...
不是因为我要去死之类的 只是...

372
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,740
Just...
只是...

373
00:18:39,290 --> 00:18:41,560
don't wait so long to come back.
别拖那么久才回来

374
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:44,030
Okay.
好的

375
00:18:44,950 --> 00:18:46,040
Okay.
好

376
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:32,680
{\an8}那桩噩事的时光

377
00:20:30,630 --> 00:20:32,310
Fuck!
靠！

378
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,730
Fuck!
靠！

379
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:34,810
What is happening?
怎么回事？

380
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:36,860
- What's happening? - Oh, my God!
- 到底怎么了？ - 靠！天呐！

381
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:38,590
I hate school!
我受够学校了！

382
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:39,760
School fucking sucks!
学校真把人逼疯了！

383
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:41,530
My brain feels like it's on fire.
我脑袋像着了火

384
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:43,170
Like I'm gonna fucking die!
像快要死了一样！

385
00:20:44,610 --> 00:20:46,490
I just realized, babe,
我才发现 宝贝

386
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:49,410
no one gives a fuck about Ted Hughes.
没人会在乎泰德·休斯

387
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:51,160
