不是故意抢先的

402
00:21:43,290 --> 00:21:44,870
That's okay.
没事的

403
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:47,130
Keep showing off, it'll get you places.
别太谦虚 真金藏不住的

404
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,960
Lydie.
利迪

405
00:21:50,430 --> 00:21:51,810
I'm Lydie.
我在这儿

406
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,090
Did you finish?
