像雾里看花

494
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:51,420
Yeah, well, even though this is medium...
嗯 我写的这中篇则...

495
00:25:51,470 --> 00:25:53,030
- The perfect length. - Yeah.
- 正好合适 - 嗯

496
00:25:53,050 --> 00:25:57,670
I have to say it is horrible, and every time I look at it, I wanna kill myself.
这书烂透了 看见它我都想上吊

