509
00:26:30,570 --> 00:26:34,820
And...I think about it all the time when I'm doing other stuff,
我 我做别的事时常想起它

510
00:26:34,840 --> 00:26:38,180
like eating ice cream or looking out the window.
吃冰淇时 望窗外时

