Oh, really, does that happen?
哦 真的吗

1349
01:30:00,490 --> 01:30:02,460
Is it my face?
因为我的脸吗？ 呵呵

1350
01:30:05,850 --> 01:30:07,640
Hello, is it my face?
因为我的脸吗？

1351
01:30:30,000 --> 01:30:31,190
Lighthouse day!
灯塔游！

1352
01:30:31,210 --> 01:30:32,300
Lighthouse day.
灯塔游

1353
01:30:32,330 --> 01:30:35,050
Fran. Fran. Lighthouse day!
弗兰 弗兰 灯塔游！

1354
01:30:35,080 --> 01:30:36,330
Lighthouse day.
灯塔游

1355
01:30:36,460 --> 01:30:38,570
Janie, Janie. Lighthouse day!
简妮 简妮 灯塔游！

1356
01:30:38,590 --> 01:30:41,030
She actually didn't sleep super well, so.
她昨晚没怎么睡 你懂的

1357
01:30:41,050 --> 01:30:41,450
Oh.
哦

1358
01:30:41,470 --> 01:30:44,280
Yeah, we're really, really fucking tired.
是啊 我们真的 真的筋疲力尽

1359
01:30:44,440 --> 01:30:47,610
Yeah, I don't think she's gonna be in for, like, a big thing today.
她今天不太适合大活动

1360
01:30:47,630 --> 01:30:48,790
The baby?
说宝宝吗？

1361
01:30:48,810 --> 01:30:51,850
Well, she's just a baby, she could do whatever.
她只是个小宝宝 应该没问题

1362
01:30:52,080 --> 01:30:53,580
I mean, not really.
其实不见得

1363
01:30:54,150 --> 01:30:56,270
But you two go. I will stay here.
你们俩去吧 我留下来

1364
01:30:56,300 --> 01:30:57,640
Oh, really? Okay.
真的？行

1365
01:30:57,690 --> 01:30:59,470
I really wanted you to see it.
我真想让你也看看

1366
01:30:59,490 --> 01:31:02,160
Babe, I will see it at some point. It's okay.
宝贝 会有机会的 放心

1367
01:31:02,950 --> 01:31:04,380
Okay.
好吧

1368
01:31:09,630 --> 01:31:10,790
No.
别

1369
01:31:11,450 --> 01:31:13,750
No, you two go.
不 你俩都去

1370
01:31:13,840 --> 01:31:16,650
No, no, someone has to stay with Jane.
不行 总得有人陪简

1371
01:31:17,130 --> 01:31:18,340
I'll do it.
我来

1372
01:31:20,400 --> 01:31:22,110
Really?
你确定？

1373
01:31:22,290 --> 01:31:24,790
Oh, Jane is actually really particular.
哦 简比较难伺候

1374
01:31:24,900 --> 01:31:26,490
I will do it.
交给我吧

1375
01:31:29,650 --> 01:31:32,020
Oh, my God. Agnes, thank you so much.
天呐 安尼丝 太谢谢你了

1376
01:31:32,050 --> 01:31:34,450
Fran, we're free! We're free.
弗兰 我们自由了！自由了！

1377
01:31:35,220 --> 01:31:36,470
The lighthouse is very romantic.
灯塔很浪漫的

1378
01:31:36,490 --> 01:31:38,380
You two should be there alone together.
就该你俩去

1379
01:31:38,400 --> 01:31:40,820
Make another baby or whatever.
再造个宝宝什么的

1380
01:31:40,840 --> 01:31:43,080
Like, twenty minutes, that's it.
就二十分钟 很快的

1381
01:31:43,100 --> 01:31:45,820
One question. What if she kills me?
问一下 她会不会把我吃了？

1382
01:31:45,840 --> 01:31:47,700
She's not gonna kill you.
她不吃人

1383
01:31:55,050 --> 01:31:56,090
Hey...
嘿...

1384
01:31:57,380 --> 01:31:59,390
Don't drop her.
别抱掉了

1385
01:32:00,210 --> 01:32:02,660
No. I won't drop her.
不会 我抱不掉的

1386
01:32:07,520 --> 01:32:08,640
Okay...
好...

1387
01:32:09,660 --> 01:32:10,910
Okay.
好了

1388
01:32:11,730 --> 01:32:12,730
Okay.
好的

1389
01:32:14,400 --> 01:32:15,530
Thank you.
谢谢

1390
01:32:16,900 --> 01:32:18,680
Here you go.
给你小兔兔

1391
01:32:19,650 --> 01:32:21,150
Thank you.
太谢谢了

1392
01:32:22,170 --> 01:32:23,820
- Here you go, babe. - Thank you.
- 给你 宝贝 - 谢谢

1393
01:32:23,870 --> 01:32:24,870
Lydie?
利迪？

1394
01:32:25,300 --> 01:32:26,470
Yeah?
嗯？

1395
01:32:27,200 --> 01:32:29,130
What do I say to her?
我该对她说点啥？

1396
01:32:29,150 --> 01:32:31,240
Babe, you don't have to say anything.
宝贝 什么都不用说

1397
01:32:31,460 --> 01:32:32,970
Twenty minutes.
就二十分钟

1398
01:33:05,120 --> 01:33:06,190
Hi.
嗨

1399
01:33:07,070 --> 01:33:08,350
I'm Agnes.
我是安尼丝

1400
01:33:11,250 --> 01:33:16,200
Pretty weird you're gonna be a person someday.
真神奇 最终你会长成个独立的人

1401
01:33:16,220 --> 01:33:18,570
No offense, but you look insane right now.
别介意 你现在真有点吓人

1402
01:33:18,590 --> 01:33:21,410
Skin and just a small amount of hair.
光溜溜 头发很少

1403
01:33:22,700 --> 01:33:24,110
Don't worry.
别担心

1404
01:33:25,100 --> 01:33:26,930
It won't be like that in a little.
很快会变样的

1405
01:33:32,990 --> 01:33:35,820
Is this okay or...
能抱抱你吗？

1406
01:33:49,510 --> 01:33:50,720
All right.
行

1407
01:33:51,870 --> 01:33:53,430
I'll put you down.
不抱了

1408
01:33:53,460 --> 01:33:55,580
Oh. I'll pick you back up.
想要啊 那就再抱起来

1409
01:33:55,600 --> 01:33:57,110
Okay, okay, okay.
抱了 抱了 抱了

1410
01:34:22,240 --> 01:34:23,850
You're so sweet looking.
你长得真漂亮

1411
01:34:39,200 --> 01:34:43,900
When you grow up, you can tell me whatever.
等你长大后 不管什么想法...

1412
01:34:44,800 --> 01:34:49,690
Like, if you have a thought and you're like, that's a bad thought,
都可以告诉我 哪怕是个坏念头

1413
01:34:50,850 --> 01:34:55,270
I probably had that same thought but, like, ten times worse.
我很可能也有过 而且更坏

1414
01:34:57,190 --> 01:34:59,570
So you can just tell me.
所以你尽管说

1415
01:35:00,220 --> 01:35:03,300
I'll never be scared by that.
我不会大惊小怪的

1416
01:35:07,700 --> 01:35:11,080
If someone does something bad to you...
要是有人对你做了桩噩事...

1417
01:35:11,180 --> 01:35:14,540
If someone says something scary...
有人借此闲言碎语 冷嘲热讽...

1418
01:35:16,140 --> 01:35:21,730
If you wanna kill yourself with like a pencil or a knife or whatever,
让你想用铅笔 刀之类的东西自尽

1419
01:35:23,460 --> 01:35:25,860
you can just tell me.
都可以跟我说

1420
01:35:28,720 --> 01:35:33,290
I'll never tell you you're scaring me.
我永远不会评头论足 大惊小怪

1421
01:35:33,330 --> 01:35:36,890
I'll just say, yeah. I know.
我只会说 嗯 我知道...

1422
01:35:37,680 --> 01:35:40,810
It's just like that sometimes.
事情有时就这样

1423
01:35:40,840 --> 01:35:41,930
Yeah.
嗯

1424
01:35:45,610 --> 01:35:46,790
I'm sorry
对不起

1425
01:35:47,820 --> 01:35:50,560
that bad things are gonna happen to you.
坏事可能会找上你

1426
01:35:52,780 --> 01:35:54,950
I hope they don't.
希望不会

1427
01:35:55,260 --> 01:35:58,740
If I can ever stop something from being bad, let me know.
要是我能阻止 一定要跟我说

1428
01:36:01,400 --> 01:36:04,890
But sometimes bad stuff just happens.
坏事不会给你打招呼

1429
01:36:07,450 --> 01:36:10,000
That's why I feel bad for you,
所以我有点心疼你

1430
01:36:10,030 --> 01:36:11,280
in a way.
某种程度上

1431
01:36:13,050 --> 01:36:19,320
That you're alive and you don't know that yet.
你活着却还体会不到

1432
01:36:25,780 --> 01:36:29,140
But I can still listen
但我还是能静心聆听的

1433
01:36:29,160 --> 01:36:31,350
and not be scared.
不会大惊小怪

1434
01:36:35,630 --> 01:36:37,250
So that's good.
这很好

1435
01:36:39,000 --> 01:36:42,070
Or that's something, at least.
至少是点儿安慰

